OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge withdrawn after body
OL,4,Afound in van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder charge against a woman has
OL,7,Fbeen withdrawn after a man's body was
OL,8,Ffound in the back of a van in
OL,9,FLeicester.
OL,11,FHarinder Kaur had been charged with
OL,12,Fmurdering Major Singh after his body
OL,13,Fwas discovered inside a Ford Transit
OL,14,Fvan in a car park in Garden Street,
OL,15,FLeicester, on 27 May.
OL,17,FProsecutors alleged Singh, who was in
OL,18,Fhis 30s, was killed in Hounslow, west
OL,19,FLondon, before being transported more
OL,20,Fthan 100 miles away.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
