OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge withdrawn after body
OL,4,Afound in van
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Old Bailey heard on Friday that the
OL,7,Fmurder charge against Kaur, 39, of
OL,8,FSutton Dene in Hounslow, west London,
OL,9,Fhad been withdrawn. Kaur denied the
OL,10,Fadditional charge of perverting the
OL,11,Fcourse of justice with a trial fixed
OL,12,Ffor 5 April 2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
